[
  {
    "title": "Collaborate, Test & Improve",
    "tag": "LESSON 04",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Chapter 1 · Putting the foundations to work",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Collaborate,<br>Test &amp; Improve</h1><p class=\"zh\">合作 · 测试 · 改进</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Chapter 1 practice project + retrieval</p>",
    "note": "本课收束自编 Chapter 1；不是官方 Big Idea 1 的完整覆盖声明。让学生准备纸笔、自己的程序编辑区和测试记录。今天的目标是留下可检查的开发过程，而不是只展示一个输出数字。Ticket Total 是入门练习，不是正式 Create 项目。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "What do you remember?",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.C · CRD-2.C/D · AAP-1.B",
    "html": "<ol><li>What decimal value is <span class=\"mono\">00110110</span>?</li><li>A kiosk receives a button press and displays a price.<br>Which is input? Which is output?</li><li><span class=\"mono\">x ← 4; y ← x; x ← 9</span><br>What value does <span class=\"mono\">y</span> now hold?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answers</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. 54 = 32 + 16 + 4 + 2.<br>2. Input: button press. Output: displayed price.<br>3. 4. The earlier assignment stored the value of x at that time.</div></details>",
    "note": "独立作答两分钟，再同桌说明第三题。这里分号仅在幻灯片上分隔语句；实验室代码必须每行一条语句，不使用分号。若把 y 判成 9，先用变量表复述赋值时间点。第一题忘记位权，允许查 L01 位权表后再试。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Success means evidence",
    "tag": "TODAY’S GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "CRD-1 · CRD-2.E–J",
    "html": "<ol><li>Share work and use a user’s feedback.</li><li>Write testable requirements and predict outputs.</li><li>Find an error, revise code, and test again.</li><li>Explain your contribution and credit shared code.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Finish with code + test records + one explained revision.</p><p class=\"zh\">证据：程序、测试记录、修改理由</p>",
    "note": "请学生把最终交付物写在纸上。项目大小受限，但解释不能只说 it works。要求说清输入、预期、实际结果和改动。四项目标也是本节形成性评价维度。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Two active roles",
    "tag": "PAIR PROGRAMMING",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "CRD-1.B.2 · CRD-1.C.1",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Driver and navigator work on shared code and exchange roles.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 270\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Driver and navigator work on shared code and exchange roles.</title><rect x=\"15\" y=\"25\" width=\"340\" height=\"185\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"445\" y=\"25\" width=\"310\" height=\"185\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"845\" y=\"25\" width=\"340\" height=\"185\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">DRIVER</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Types the agreed change</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Explains each line</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">SHARED PROGRAM</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Input → calculation</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">→ output</text><text x=\"1015\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">NAVIGATOR</text><text x=\"1015\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Predicts test results</text><text x=\"1015\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Checks requirements</text><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"435\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"435,90 425.3465918192059,95.27368092464623 425.3465918192059,84.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"165\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"365,165 374.6534081807941,159.72631907535376 374.6534081807941,170.27368092464624\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><line x1=\"765\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"835\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"835,90 825.3465918192059,95.27368092464623 825.3465918192059,84.72631907535377\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><line x1=\"840\" y1=\"165\" x2=\"770\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"770,165 779.6534081807941,159.72631907535376 779.6534081807941,170.27368092464624\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">Talk through the evidence. Switch roles at the checkpoint.</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Both partners should be able to explain the whole program.</p>",
    "note": "两人均须参与，不把 navigator 当旁观者。让学生演练一句建设性回应：“Let us test input 2 against the requirement.” 交换角色是课堂合作安排，不是官方固定的配对规则。用共享文档记录测试，纸笔同样可用；线上工具可保留评论、代码版本和反馈。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Whose experience is missing?",
    "tag": "USER PERSPECTIVES",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "CRD-1.A.3–6",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">A ticket program works for its developers.<br>A first-time visitor sees only <span class=\"mono\">27</span>.</p><ol><li>What might the visitor misunderstand?</li><li>What could you ask or observe?</li><li>Suggest one change based on that evidence.</li></ol><details><summary>One justified improvement</summary><div class=\"answer\">Ask the visitor what 27 means. If the price and fee are unclear, display a total label and state that the booking fee is included. Test with that visitor again.</div></details>",
    "note": "先让学生提出具体受众差异，如首次使用者、不熟悉票价规则的人、需要更清楚文字说明的人。不同经历帮助发现设计盲点；不能声称多一个人就保证无偏差。要求从观察或用户反馈推出改动，不能只凭开发者个人喜好。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A process can revisit earlier work",
    "tag": "ITERATIVE DEVELOPMENT",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.E.1–4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Investigate, design, prototype and test with feedback returning to earlier phases.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 270\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Investigate, design, prototype and test with feedback returning to earlier phases.</title><rect x=\"20\" y=\"35\" width=\"245\" height=\"102\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"142.5\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Investigate</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"35\" width=\"245\" height=\"102\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"447.5\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Design</text><rect x=\"630\" y=\"35\" width=\"245\" height=\"102\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"752.5\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Prototype</text><rect x=\"935\" y=\"35\" width=\"245\" height=\"102\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1057.5\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Test</text><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"315\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"315,86 305.3465918192059,91.27368092464623 305.3465918192059,80.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"580\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"620,86 610.3465918192059,91.27368092464623 610.3465918192059,80.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"885\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"925\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"925,86 915.3465918192059,91.27368092464623 915.3465918192059,80.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"1058\" y1=\"147\" x2=\"1058\" y2=\"206\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"142\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"1058\" y2=\"206\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"142\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"142\" y2=\"146\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"142,146 147.27368092464624,155.6534081807941 136.72631907535376,155.6534081807941\" fill=\"#d3ad62\"/><line x1=\"447\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"447\" y2=\"146\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"447,146 452.2736809246462,155.6534081807941 441.7263190753538,155.6534081807941\" fill=\"#d3ad62\"/><line x1=\"752\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"752\" y2=\"146\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"752,146 757.2736809246462,155.6534081807941 746.7263190753538,155.6534081807941\" fill=\"#d3ad62\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">Feedback can reopen any earlier phase.</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\"><strong>Iterative:</strong> revise using feedback. <strong>Incremental:</strong> build and test one small part before adding another.</p>",
    "note": "这是一个可用过程示例，不是开发的唯一顺序。迭代强调根据反馈修订；增量强调小部分正确后再扩展。二者可以同时发生。口头追问：新增预订费后发现需求表述不清，需要回到哪一阶段？接受回到调查/设计并解释原因。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Turn a request into requirements",
    "tag": "TICKET TOTAL",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.F.1–7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ticket order requirements flow from valid ticket count through per-ticket price and one order fee to labeled total.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 250\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Ticket order requirements flow from valid ticket count through per-ticket price and one order fee to labeled total.</title><rect x=\"15\" y=\"48\" width=\"255\" height=\"154\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"142\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">INPUT</text><text x=\"142\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">1–50 tickets</text><text x=\"142\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Whole numbers</text><line x1=\"282\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"333\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"333,122 323.3465918192059,127.27368092464623 323.3465918192059,116.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"345\" y=\"25\" width=\"495\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"365\" y=\"48\" width=\"215\" height=\"146\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"472\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">TICKET COST</text><text x=\"472\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">12 × tickets</text><text x=\"472\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">per-ticket price</text><text x=\"603\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"42\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">+</text><rect x=\"630\" y=\"48\" width=\"190\" height=\"146\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f4edda\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"725\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">ORDER FEE</text><text x=\"725\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><text x=\"725\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">once per order</text><line x1=\"852\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"903\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"903,122 893.3465918192059,127.27368092464623 893.3465918192059,116.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"915\" y=\"48\" width=\"270\" height=\"154\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1050\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">OUTPUT</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"133\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Labeled total</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Fee included</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Each requirement should be testable. This version assumes valid input.</p>",
    "note": "逐条询问是否能被检查。澄清 fee 是每单一次，不是每张一次。本练习在有效输入前提下计算，不实现无效输入拒绝；请先在纸上记明限制。界面设计可以很简单：文字输入提示和标明含费的输出。单位不指定国家货币，以免引入汇率或税费。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Predict before you press Run",
    "tag": "EXPECTED RESULTS",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.J.1 · CRD-2.J.3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three test inputs each require an independently predicted output: minimum one, multiple tickets two, and maximum fifty.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 260\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Three test inputs each require an independently predicted output: minimum one, multiple tickets two, and maximum fifty.</title><rect x=\"340\" y=\"8\" width=\"520\" height=\"58\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Expected total = tickets × 12 + 3</text><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"990\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"600\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"210,110 204.72631907535376,100.3465918192059 215.27368092464624,100.3465918192059\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"115\" width=\"340\" height=\"130\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">INPUT 1</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Minimum valid</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">Expected: ?</text><line x1=\"600\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"600,110 594.7263190753538,100.3465918192059 605.2736809246462,100.3465918192059\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"430\" y=\"115\" width=\"340\" height=\"130\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">INPUT 2</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">More than one ticket</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">Expected: ?</text><line x1=\"990\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"990\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"990,110 984.7263190753538,100.3465918192059 995.2736809246462,100.3465918192059\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"820\" y=\"115\" width=\"340\" height=\"130\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"990\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">INPUT 50</text><text x=\"990\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Maximum valid</text><text x=\"990\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">Expected: ?</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Calculate each expectation from the requirements before you run the program.</p><details><summary>Show expected results</summary><div class=\"answer\">1 → 15 · 2 → 27 · 50 → 603.<br>Calculate these from the requirements, independently of the program.</div></details>",
    "note": "不让学生先运行再把屏幕数字抄进 expected 一栏。正确顺序是依据要求手算，再运行并填写 actual。三个有效测试覆盖下界、能揭露每张收费错误的非单张情况和上界；不是声称三次测试证明所有程序都正确。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A boundary or an invalid input?",
    "tag": "INPUT DOMAIN",
    "time": "28–32 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.F · CRD-2.J.2–3",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Valid input: an integer from 1 through 50.</p><div class=\"options\"><p><strong>A.</strong> 0</p><p><strong>B.</strong> 1</p><p><strong>C.</strong> 50</p><p><strong>D.</strong> 51</p></div><p>Which are valid boundaries? Which are outside the domain?</p><details><summary>Show answer and project limit</summary><div class=\"answer\">Valid boundaries: 1 and 50. Outside: 0 and 51.<br>This version assumes valid input. A displayed 3 for input 0 does not mean that 0 is a valid order. Input rejection is not implemented.</div></details>",
    "note": "强调界限测试可包括刚好在范围内及刚好在范围外的值，但预期行为要来自需求。当前版本对范围外输入没有承诺“弹出错误”，不能把尚未提出的拒绝要求当成已实现。本项目可以记录 0、51 为后续验证设计案例，不要求写 IF。"
  },
  {
    "title": "One passing test can hide the fault",
    "tag": "EXPECTED ≠ ACTUAL",
    "time": "32–36 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.I.a · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<p>A developer writes:</p><div class=\"code\">total ← tickets * (12 + 3)</div><table><tr><th>tickets</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual from this line</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>15</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>27</td><td>30</td></tr></table><details><summary>Explain the mismatch</summary><div class=\"answer\">The code charges the fee for every ticket. Input 1 cannot reveal that mistake; input 2 can. Use tickets * 12 + 3.</div></details>",
    "note": "不只要求报出逻辑错误这个名词。让学生指出括号导致 3 也被 tickets 乘，并说明一张票时两种收费模式恰好一致。将测试输入选择与需求联系起来。不要把“测试可发现错误”讲成“有限测试必然发现所有错误”。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Three useful error categories",
    "tag": "ERRORS",
    "time": "36–40 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.I.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Inspect language rules for syntax faults, execution for reported run-time faults, and output against requirements for logic faults.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 255\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Inspect language rules for syntax faults, execution for reported run-time faults, and output against requirements for logic faults.</title><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"380\" height=\"58\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Language rules</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"95\" width=\"380\" height=\"145\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">SYNTAX</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">A required “)” is missing.</text><rect x=\"410\" y=\"10\" width=\"380\" height=\"58\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Execution</text><rect x=\"410\" y=\"95\" width=\"380\" height=\"145\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">RUN-TIME</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">A reported division-by-zero</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"209\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">fault occurs while running.</text><rect x=\"810\" y=\"10\" width=\"380\" height=\"58\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1000\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Result vs requirement</text><rect x=\"810\" y=\"95\" width=\"380\" height=\"145\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1000\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">LOGIC</text><text x=\"1000\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">The program runs but</text><text x=\"1000\" y=\"209\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">charges the wrong fee.</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Run-time behavior depends on the language. Here, the division-by-zero example assumes that the language reports an error.</p>",
    "note": "语法示例假定 DISPLAY 必须成对括号。运行时错误举例须带语言前提，不把所有语言的除零结果说成一致。实验室是受限教学执行器，诊断与完整编程语言不同；不要声称它展示了每种语言的错误机制。溢出另回连 L01：固定宽度超范围也属于表示限制。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Diagnose from evidence",
    "tag": "QUICK CHECK",
    "time": "40–43 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.I.a",
    "html": "<ol><li>A parser rejects a missing closing parenthesis.</li><li>The program runs; 2 tickets cost 30 instead of 27.</li><li>Execution stops at division by zero; this language reports it as an error.</li></ol><details><summary>Classify and justify</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. Syntax: the statement violates the grammar.<br>2. Logic: execution succeeds but contradicts the requirement.<br>3. Run-time: the fault occurs during execution.</div></details>",
    "note": "先让每组选择一个案例给出“类别 + 证据”，再揭晓全体答案。若学生只说 crash，追问是解析阶段、执行阶段还是输出不符合需求。不要用“没有报错就没有错误”作为判断。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Trace the first wrong value",
    "tag": "DEBUGGING",
    "time": "43–47 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.I.a/b · AAP-1.B",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\"><div><p class=\"small\">Input: 2 tickets</p><div class=\"code\">subtotal ← 2 * 12<br>total ← subtotal + 3<br>total ← total + 3<br>DISPLAY(total)</div></div><div><p>Trace <span class=\"mono\">subtotal</span> and <span class=\"mono\">total</span>.</p><p>Which statement first creates a value that violates the requirement?</p></div></div><details><summary>Show trace and correction</summary><div class=\"answer\">subtotal = 24; total = 27; then total = 30.<br>The second fee addition is wrong. Remove it; output becomes 27.</div></details>",
    "note": "让学生在每个赋值后更新变量表，特别看第三行第一次偏离收费要求。只移除重复收费行；不要碰已经正确的 subtotal。修复后仍需用 1、2、50 重测。此处常量 2 是手工跟踪场景，最终程序必须读取输入。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Use a repeatable debugging routine",
    "tag": "FIND → FIX → CHECK",
    "time": "47–50 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.I.5 · CRD-2.J.1",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A debugging path: reproduce a failure, compare expected and actual, trace values, correct the cause, and retest.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 265\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>A debugging path: reproduce a failure, compare expected and actual, trace values, correct the cause, and retest.</title><rect x=\"5\" y=\"20\" width=\"210\" height=\"135\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Reproduce</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Known input</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Same failure</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"20\" width=\"210\" height=\"135\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"355\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Compare</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Expected</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">versus actual</text><rect x=\"495\" y=\"20\" width=\"210\" height=\"135\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Trace</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">First wrong</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">value</text><rect x=\"740\" y=\"20\" width=\"210\" height=\"135\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"845\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Correct</text><text x=\"845\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Explain</text><text x=\"845\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">the change</text><rect x=\"985\" y=\"20\" width=\"210\" height=\"135\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1090\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Retest</text><text x=\"1090\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Failed case</text><text x=\"1090\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">+ earlier tests</text><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"244,88 234.3465918192059,93.27368092464623 234.3465918192059,82.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"465\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"489\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"489,88 479.3465918192059,93.27368092464623 479.3465918192059,82.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"734\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"734,88 724.3465918192059,93.27368092464623 724.3465918192059,82.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"955\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"979\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"979,88 969.3465918192059,93.27368092464623 969.3465918192059,82.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"1090\" y1=\"164\" x2=\"1090\" y2=\"206\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"600\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"1090\" y2=\"206\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"600\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"600,162 605.2736809246462,171.6534081807941 594.7263190753538,171.6534081807941\" fill=\"#d3ad62\"/><text x=\"846\" y=\"249\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">Mismatch remains? Trace again.</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Use a trace table or temporary DISPLAY statements to make intermediate values visible.</p>",
    "note": "用上一页的 2 张票复述五步。临时 DISPLAY 用于检查中间值，确认后可删去或改为用户需要的信息。对能力强者追问：只改 expected 以匹配 actual 为何不能证明修复？需要回到原需求进行独立核验。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Plan your own Ticket Total",
    "tag": "PROJECT · DESIGN",
    "time": "50–54 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.E/F · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<ol><li>Sketch the input prompt and labeled output.</li><li>Choose names for tickets, price, fee and total.</li><li>Write the calculation in words.</li><li>Record expected totals for 1, 2 and 50.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Use sequence, variables, arithmetic, INPUT() and DISPLAY().</p><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_1_Programming_Lab.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the Chapter 1 Programming Lab</a> · Practice project; not a full Create task.</p>",
    "note": "此时进入 30 分钟项目块。学生先在纸上独立规划，再与同伴沟通。有两台设备时各自写一份自己的代码；一台设备时结对输入但每人留下独立解释和角色记录。语言范围限定在已教的顺序、变量、算术和输入输出，不加入条件、列表、循环或过程。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Build a small working version",
    "tag": "PROJECT · IMPLEMENT",
    "time": "54–62 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.E · AAP foundations",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Write your own code in the <a href=\"Chapter_1_Programming_Lab.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Programming Lab</a>.</p><ol><li>Read a ticket count using <span class=\"mono\">INPUT()</span>.</li><li>Compute the ticket cost and one booking fee.</li><li>Display a label and the total.</li><li>Save a copy of the code you wrote.</li></ol><p class=\"small\">One statement per line. Use ← or &lt;- for assignment.<br>Start with one numeric input, such as 2.</p><p class=\"zh\">先预测，再运行；保留自己写出的程序版本。</p>",
    "note": "给八分钟安静开发，教师只提供方向性提示。可先让票价部分正确，再增加每单费用。若学生从实验室 starter 修改，应说明自己修改了哪些行；不要把预设代码算作自己的完整原创。INPUT 输入队列使用数字；一次运行本程序只需一个数。字符串仅用于 DISPLAY 提示，不要求拼接或格式化货币小数。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Switch roles. Test the requirement.",
    "tag": "PROJECT · TEST",
    "time": "62–67 min",
    "code": "CRD-1.B/C · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<table><tr><th>Input</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Pass / revise?</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>15</td><td>Record your run.</td><td>Compare.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>27</td><td>Record your run.</td><td>Compare.</td></tr><tr><td>50</td><td>603</td><td>Record your run.</td><td>Compare.</td></tr></table><p class=\"callout\">For a failure, record the incorrect line and the correction.<br>Then rerun all three cases.</p><p class=\"small\">These tests check selected valid inputs; input validation is not implemented.</p>",
    "note": "切换 driver/navigator。每次新运行在输入框放一个测试数，不能把 1、2、50 全放入后只运行一次便称完成三次测试。实验室可能保留旧输入或旧输出，要求学生对应每次 Run 的结果。全过者继续检查输出标签与用户理解，不无故制造错误。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Ask a user, then revise",
    "tag": "PROJECT · FEEDBACK",
    "time": "67–72 min",
    "code": "CRD-1.A.5/6 · CRD-2.E/F",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A user-feedback loop links trying the program, recording observations, making a justified change and checking again.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 275\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>A user-feedback loop links trying the program, recording observations, making a justified change and checking again.</title><rect x=\"20\" y=\"25\" width=\"245\" height=\"145\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"142.5\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">User tries</text><text x=\"142.5\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">No explanation</text><text x=\"142.5\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">from the author</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"25\" width=\"245\" height=\"145\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"447.5\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Record</text><text x=\"447.5\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Exact comment</text><text x=\"447.5\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">or observation</text><rect x=\"630\" y=\"25\" width=\"245\" height=\"145\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"752.5\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Revise</text><text x=\"752.5\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">A change linked</text><text x=\"752.5\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">to the evidence</text><rect x=\"935\" y=\"25\" width=\"245\" height=\"145\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1057.5\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Check again</text><text x=\"1057.5\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">User understanding</text><text x=\"1057.5\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">+ numeric tests</text><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"313\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"313,100 303.3465918192059,105.27368092464623 303.3465918192059,94.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"580\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"618\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"618,100 608.3465918192059,105.27368092464623 608.3465918192059,94.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"885\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"923\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"923,100 913.3465918192059,105.27368092464623 913.3465918192059,94.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"1058\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"1058\" y2=\"218\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"142\" y1=\"218\" x2=\"1058\" y2=\"218\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"142\" y1=\"218\" x2=\"142\" y2=\"177\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"142,177 147.27368092464624,186.6534081807941 136.72631907535376,186.6534081807941\" fill=\"#d3ad62\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">Keep the before-and-after version and the reason for the change.</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Invite another pair to test your program. Ask them what the displayed total means.</p>",
    "note": "让另一组作用户，不由作者站在旁边解释全部规则。若一开始标签已经清楚，可依据反馈澄清有效输入范围或每单费用；不要求为了有改动而破坏已满足的要求。用户要求支持 0 张、折扣或退票时，先记录为后续需求；本版不实现分支验证。让学生保留改前、改后措辞与对应反馈。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Leave a useful development record",
    "tag": "PROJECT · DOCUMENT",
    "time": "72–76 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.G/H",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A saved program is accompanied by purpose, test evidence, revision history and source credit.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 270\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>A saved program is accompanied by purpose, test evidence, revision history and source credit.</title><rect x=\"15\" y=\"55\" width=\"310\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">SAVED PROGRAM</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Your code version</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">+ development record</text><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"390\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"390\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"432\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"432,62 422.3465918192059,67.27368092464623 422.3465918192059,56.726319075353764\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"390\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"432\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"432,200 422.3465918192059,205.27368092464624 422.3465918192059,194.72631907535376\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"445\" y=\"5\" width=\"355\" height=\"110\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"622\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">PURPOSE</text><text x=\"622\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">User + problem solved</text><rect x=\"825\" y=\"5\" width=\"360\" height=\"110\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">TESTS</text><text x=\"1005\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Input · expected · actual</text><rect x=\"445\" y=\"145\" width=\"355\" height=\"110\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"622\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">REVISION</text><text x=\"622\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Feedback → change → check</text><rect x=\"825\" y=\"145\" width=\"360\" height=\"110\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">CREDIT</text><text x=\"1005\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Contribution + code source</text><line x1=\"804\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"817\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"817,60 807.3465918192059,65.27368092464623 807.3465918192059,54.726319075353764\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"804\" y1=\"201\" x2=\"817\" y2=\"201\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"817,201 807.3465918192059,206.27368092464624 807.3465918192059,195.72631907535376\" fill=\"#225a83\"/></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Documentation can sit beside the executable code. Credit shared or adapted code accurately; if none was used, say so.</p>",
    "note": "文档不是复述每一行中文翻译，而是帮助读者理解目的、限制与开发过程。若使用老师 starter、同伴代码或其他来源，应指明具体片段与来源/作者；自己写完的部分也说明贡献。实验室子集不要求支持代码注释，直接把说明写在单独记录里。正式 Create 的引用和合作规范将单独教学，不能据此认定正式任务已完成。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Can someone else verify your work?",
    "tag": "PROJECT · REVIEW",
    "time": "76–80 min",
    "code": "CRD-1.C · CRD-2.G/J",
    "html": "<table><tr><th>Evidence</th><th>Reviewer checks</th></tr><tr><td>Code</td><td>The fee is added once; input and output are clear.</td></tr><tr><td>Tests</td><td>1 → 15, 2 → 27, 50 → 603 are recorded.</td></tr><tr><td>Revision</td><td>Feedback led to an explained change and retesting.</td></tr><tr><td>Contribution</td><td>Each partner explains the code and credits sources.</td></tr></table><p class=\"small\">Teacher feedback: secure / revise / missing evidence.<br>This classroom review is not an AP Create scoring rubric.</p>",
    "note": "用每项 0–2 的形成性量表，详细标准在教师指南。八分只是课堂诊断，不换算 AP 分数。每人随机解释一条计算或一个测试，避免一人包办。记录后续补救学生：不能独立解释赋值的回 L03，fee 乘错的做对比测试，反馈过泛的重访用户。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Chapter check: select TWO",
    "tag": "ORIGINAL AP-STYLE PRACTICE",
    "time": "80–84 min",
    "code": "Chapter 1 · Representation + development",
